    {
      "source": "Java Records are ideal to define DTO types since they adhere to value semantics:\nAll fields are <code>private final</code> and <code>equals(…)</code>/<code>hashCode()</code>/<code>toString()</code> methods are created automatically.\nAlternatively, you can use any class that defines the properties you want to project.",
      "translation": "Java 记录类型非常适合定义 DTO 类型，因为它们遵循值语义：所有字段均为 <code>private final</code>，并且会自动生成 <code>equals(…)</code>、<code>hashCode()</code> 和 <code>toString()</code> 方法。  \n或者，您也可以使用任何定义了所需投影属性的类。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "When using <a href=\"#projections.dtos\">Class-based projection</a>, types must declare a single constructor so that Spring Data can determine their input properties.\nIf your class defines more than one constructor, then you cannot use the type without further hints for DTO projections.\nIn such a case annotate the desired constructor with <code>@PersistenceCreator</code> as outlined below so that Spring Data can determine which properties to select:",
      "translation": "在使用基于类的投影（<a href=\"#projections.dtos\">Class-based projection</a>）时，类型必须声明单个构造函数，以便 Spring Data 能够确定其输入属性。如果类定义了多个构造函数，则无法在不提供进一步提示的情况下使用该类型的 DTO 投影。在这种情况下，请按照以下说明使用 <code>@PersistenceCreator</code> 注解标记所需的构造函数，以便 Spring Data 能够确定要选择的属性：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Another way of defining projections is by using value type DTOs (Data Transfer Objects) that hold properties for the fields that are supposed to be retrieved.\nThese DTO types can be used in exactly the same way projection interfaces are used, except that no proxying happens and no nested projections can be applied.",
      "translation": "另一种定义投影的方法是使用值类型 DTO（数据传输对象），这些对象包含用于获取字段的属性。  \n这些 DTO 类型的使用方式与投影接口完全相同，唯一的区别是它们不会发生代理操作，且无法应用嵌套投影。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If the store optimizes the query execution by limiting the fields to be loaded, the fields to be loaded are determined from the parameter names of the constructor that is exposed.",
      "translation": "如果商店通过限制加载的字段来优化查询执行，则待加载的字段将从所暴露的构造函数参数名称中确定。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following example shows a projecting DTO:",
      "translation": "以下示例展示了一个投影 DTO：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "So far, we have used the projection type as the return type or element type of a collection.\nHowever, you might want to select the type to be used at invocation time (which makes it dynamic).\nTo apply dynamic projections, use a query method such as the one shown in the following example:",
      "translation": "到目前为止，我们一直使用投影类型作为集合的返回类型或元素类型。\n然而，您可能希望在调用时选择要使用的类型（这使其具有动态性）。\n若要应用动态投影，请使用查询方法，例如以下示例中所示的方法：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This way, the method can be used to obtain the aggregates as is or with a projection applied, as shown in the following example:",
      "translation": "这样，该方法可用于获取聚合结果本身，或应用投影后的结果，如下例所示：",
      "count": 1
    },
